            "label": "Offer end date and time (ISO)",
            "placeholder": "2026-12-31T23:59+05:30",
            "description": "Use YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM with Z or a timezone offset. Example: 2026-12-31T23:59+05:30 (Sri Lanka time)."
